<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-5"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">CSV Import &amp; Export</h1><p>Use the sponsor's Student Applications, Courses &amp; Sections, and Selection &amp; Assignment templates. Select the cycle explicitly. Existing submissions are retained; conflicting duplicates are rejected.</p>
<form id="csvForm" class="card p-5 space-y-4"><label class="block">Dataset<select id="csvDataset" class="input"><option value="students">Student Applications</option><option value="courses">Courses &amp; Sections</option><option value="selections">Selection &amp; Assignment</option></select></label><label class="block">Application cycle<select id="csvPeriod" class="input" required></select></label>
<div id="csvCourseOptions" class="space-y-3 hidden"><label class="block" id="csvOwnerLabel">Course organiser (new courses)<select id="csvOwner" class="input"></select></label><label class="block">Department for new courses<input id="csvDepartment" class="input" value="Biological Sciences" maxlength="200"></label><label class="block">Hours per TA per week (not supplied by the CSV)<input id="csvHours" type="number" min="0.1" max="168" step="any" class="input" placeholder="Enter the agreed workload"></label></div>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><button id="csvTemplate" class="btn btn-outline" type="button">Download template</button><button id="csvExport" class="btn btn-outline" type="button">Export this cycle</button></div>
<fieldset id="csvImportControls" class="space-y-4"><legend class="font-semibold">Import</legend><p>Import courses first, then students, then selection records. Preview validates all rows without saving. The final import is all-or-nothing. New imported student accounts are suspended with unknown random passwords; existing accounts retain their credentials. Admin can activate and set an individual password later.</p><p>Selected imports record an authenticated selection decision and proposed Section; they do not publish an assignment or claim student acceptance. CSV conflicts do not confirm full availability. Responsible User text is retained as source information; the audit actor is your signed-in account.</p><label class="block">CSV file (UTF-8, up to 2 MB)<input id="csvFile" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv" class="input"></label><button id="csvPreview" class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Preview import</button><button id="csvCommit" class="btn btn-primary" type="button" disabled>Import validated rows</button></fieldset></form>
<p id="csvMessage" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="card overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-sm text-left"><thead><tr><th class="p-3">CSV row</th><th class="p-3">Result</th><th class="p-3">Details</th></tr></thead><tbody id="csvRows"></tbody></table></div></div>
